# comment. List only commits that change formatting and nothing else, such
# as the one-time Prettier reformat of frontend/src. Its squash SHA is added
# in a follow-up PR, because it exists only after the reformat PR merges.
#
# GitHub reads this file on its own. Locally, `make install-hooks` sets
# `blame.ignoreRevsFile` to it.
